@title: slow_feed
@context: The feed loaded to its end, a toast that goes away, then a report.
@tags: slow
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open the slow page
    NAVIGATE to 'Slow page'
    VERIFY that 'Feed item 2' is present

STEP 2: More of the feed
    CLICK the 'Load more' button
    VERIFY that 'Feed item 4' is present

STEP 3: The rest of the feed
    CLICK the 'Load more' button
    VERIFY that 'Feed item 6' is present
    VERIFY that 'Load more' is NOT present

STEP 4: Save the settings
    CLICK the 'Save settings' button
    VERIFY that 'Settings saved' is present

STEP 5: The toast goes
    WAIT FOR 'Settings saved' to disappear
    VERIFY that 'Settings saved' is NOT present

STEP 6: Build the report
    CLICK the 'Build report' button
    VERIFY that 'Report ready: 3 orders' is present

STEP 7: Go home
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

DONE.
